# Vercel builds ONLY the Next.js frontend (repository root).
# Worker V2 is a completely independent PNPM workspace deployed separately on Render — Vercel must
# never upload, install, type-check, or build it. Excluding it here keeps the two deployables fully
# decoupled and the frontend build fast. (Render deploys with Root Directory = worker, so it never
# reads this file.)
worker
